            <div xml:id="d628-a1-a3">

                <pb facs="0741" n="699" sameAs="frus:frus1863p1/pg699"/>

                <head ana="#head_untitled-missing-head-in-printed-volume">[Untitled]</head>
                <p>The situation of Mr. J. M. Vernon having been referred to me, I addressed a
                    letter of inquiry to Colonel Dimmick, and received the accompanying answer,
                    dated Headquarters, Fort Warren, September 17, 1863, and am of opinion that the
                    case of Vernon calls for no special orders at this time.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>E. A. HITCHCOCK, <hi rendition="#italic">Major General Volunteers,
                            Commissioner for Exchange of Prisoners.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
